  data: {
    LLM: "The player to dealer's right leads any card. Other players must follow suit. A player who cannot follow suit must draw cards one at a time from the stock until finding a card of the required suit, which must then be played. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick, and the winner leads to the next trick. If the stock runs out, players who cannot follow suit simply pass without playing.",
    Player: "The player to dealer's right leads any card. Other players must follow suit. A player who cannot follow suit must draw cards one at a time from the stock until finding a card of the required suit, which must then be played. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick, and the winner leads to the next trick. If the stock runs out, players who cannot follow suit simply pass without playing.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to play all your cards. The last player holding cards loses the hand and receives a penalty point.',
    gameplay: "The player to dealer's right leads any card. Other players must follow suit. A player who cannot follow suit must draw cards one at a time from the stock until finding a card of the required suit, which must then be played. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick, and the winner leads to the next trick. If the stock runs out, players who cannot follow suit simply pass without playing.",
    keyRules: [
      'Must follow suit if possible',
      'If unable to follow, draw from stock until finding playable card',
      'Highest card of led suit wins the trick',
      'Winner of trick leads to next trick',
      'When stock is exhausted, players who cannot follow pass',
      'Last player with cards loses the hand',
      'Game ends when a player reaches agreed penalty point total',
